      "writtenOn": "2014-10-03T01:00:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re forcing a lid state change but not going through the state transitions for that.  So I think you need to do:\n\n  /* Override lid open if necessary */\n  forced_lid_open \u003d p-\u003eenabled ? 1 : 0;\n\n  /* Make this take effect immediately; no debounce time */\n  hook_call_deferred(lid_change_deferred, 0);\n\nThat way, you\u0027re effectively overriding the lid switch GPIO, and allowing everything to remain in a consistent state.\n\nAnd if you send the host command to UN-override the lid open state, it\u0027ll cause a lid-close transition if the lid really is closed.",
